#. type: cindex
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:7915
#, no-wrap
msgid "Aspect ratio of images"
msgstr ""

#. type: cindex
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:7916
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distorting images"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:7921
msgid ""
"The optional @var{width} and @var{height} arguments to the @code{@@image} "
"command (see the previous section) specify the size to which to scale the "
"image.  They are only taken into account in printed output."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:7926
msgid ""
"In @TeX{}, if neither is specified, the image is presented in its natural "
"size (given in the file); if only one is specified, the other is scaled "
"proportionately; and if both are specified, both are respected, thus likely "
"distorting the original image by changing its aspect ratio."
msgstr ""

#. type: cindex
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:7927
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dimensions and image sizes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:7930
msgid ""
"The @var{width} and @var{height} may be specified using any valid @TeX{} "
"dimension, namely:"
