#. type: Plain text
#: texinfo/upstream/texinfo.texi:9523
msgid ""
"The left quote character (@t{`}, ASCII code 96) used in Texinfo is a grave "
"accent in ANSI and ISO character set standards.  We use it as a quote "
"character because that is how @TeX{} is set up, by default."
msgstr ""

